WEBVTT

00:00.470 --> 00:02.980
<b>Day 17</b>

00:05.100 --> 00:06.780
Gobjii, wake up.

00:07.520 --> 00:09.490
What is it?

00:10.450 --> 00:12.500
Something awful happened.

00:17.250 --> 00:21.750
Unbelievable. All the human women...

00:22.560 --> 00:25.500
<i>They probably did it because
 they had lost all hope.</i>

00:26.370 --> 00:29.500
<i>After they they took a poison that let 
them pass peacefully in their sleep,</i>

00:29.810 --> 00:32.460
<i>Gobjii and I had a quiet memorial for them.</i>

00:36.430 --> 00:38.930
<b>Day 26</b>

00:40.640 --> 00:42.940
You're falling behind, Gobe!

00:43.280 --> 00:45.390
I dunno whacha want me to say to that!

00:45.390 --> 00:51.080
<i>A few days passed, and I had begun 
training the goblins from my generation.</i>

00:51.450 --> 00:54.820
<i>While doing that, I also ate 
any promising enemies I could find</i>

00:54.820 --> 00:57.750
<i>to learn a lot of new abilities.</i>

01:00.210 --> 01:01.850
Someone's coming.

01:01.850 --> 01:02.960
Right.

01:05.820 --> 01:08.410
They look like goblins, but...

01:09.720 --> 01:11.970
H-Hang on!

01:11.970 --> 01:14.630
They're our raiders!

01:14.630 --> 01:15.850
Raiders?

01:15.850 --> 01:18.850
Basically, they're the fathers
of your generation!

02:58.020 --> 03:01.540
It's good to see you back, Hobken!

03:01.540 --> 03:05.040
And with such a promising haul, too!

03:06.060 --> 03:09.540
<i>Those are... humans, right?</i>

03:10.390 --> 03:12.440
They look so lively!

03:12.440 --> 03:17.130
The last batch you captured 
are gone, so this works out nicely.

03:17.130 --> 03:19.550
<i>Goblin DNA is so strong</i>

03:19.550 --> 03:23.560
<i>that when they mate with other species, 
it still results in goblin children.</i>

03:24.440 --> 03:27.810
<i>I can understand the instinct to reproduce...</i>

03:27.810 --> 03:31.070
<i>But that doesn't mean I feel great about it.</i>

03:32.610 --> 03:36.460
Is it alright if I look 
after these human women?

03:37.850 --> 03:39.200
Who the hell are you?!

03:39.200 --> 03:41.260
Newborn little punk!

03:41.260 --> 03:42.200
Gobrou!

03:48.210 --> 03:50.210
Oh, dear...

03:54.160 --> 03:57.220
Okay, both sides, settle down.

03:57.220 --> 04:01.380
We'd appreciate not getting 
dragged into a civil war.

04:01.380 --> 04:03.710
Seriously! Those are so annoying.

04:03.980 --> 04:05.220
Who are they?

04:05.220 --> 04:09.310
That's Hobsato and the mage, Hobsei.

04:09.310 --> 04:13.230
Why don't the leaders of our 
respective generations fight,

04:13.230 --> 04:17.740
and then the winner decides what 
the village is gonna do from now on?

04:17.740 --> 04:20.290
No weapons allowed, of course.

04:20.290 --> 04:24.380
Fine by me. This little punk 
needs to be taught a lesson.

04:24.380 --> 04:26.300
I'm good with that.

04:26.300 --> 04:27.750
It's settled then.

04:30.710 --> 04:32.750
What the hell is this string?!

04:32.750 --> 04:35.220
Looks like the lesson's been taught.

04:35.220 --> 04:38.980
Gobrou, where were you hiding all that?!

04:38.980 --> 04:41.030
It's not a weapon, okay?

04:41.480 --> 04:44.840
My body makes it, so it's like spit.

04:45.290 --> 04:50.020
<i>Good thing I learned how to produce 
spider silk from that demon spider.</i>

04:50.960 --> 04:52.270
Impressive.

04:52.270 --> 04:57.740
I'm surprised to see someone like that was 
born while we were away from the village.

04:58.530 --> 05:03.530
That makes me officially the leader 
of this village. Any problems?

05:06.200 --> 05:07.170
Fine...

05:07.170 --> 05:08.840
We get it.

05:11.670 --> 05:15.540
I've told the others they're 
not to lay a hand on you.

05:16.080 --> 05:21.550
I don't intend on doing anything either, 
and I'll make sure you're looked after.

05:21.970 --> 05:25.580
We'll see about you getting back 
to a human village someday, too.

05:26.130 --> 05:27.150
Excuse me...

05:27.720 --> 05:30.910
Then, what do we have to do?

05:30.910 --> 05:35.370
<i>I wasn't being completely 
selfless in saving them.</i>

05:35.370 --> 05:36.420
<i>Because...</i>

05:36.780 --> 05:38.460
Nothing special.

05:42.230 --> 05:44.820
I just want your human knowledge.

05:47.390 --> 05:50.070
<i>It turns out they were part 
of a traveling business</i>

05:50.070 --> 05:53.460
<i>when the older goblins attacked them.</i>

05:53.460 --> 05:56.090
<i>The men were slaughtered,</i>

05:56.090 --> 05:59.480
<i>and these five were the only survivors.</i>

06:18.360 --> 06:20.860
<b>Day 28</b>

06:21.350 --> 06:22.790
Good morning!

06:26.370 --> 06:28.710
Hey, good morning...

06:27.300 --> 06:29.770
<i>I think it's less that they've gotten over it,</i>

06:29.770 --> 06:33.650
<i>and more like they realize a positive 
attitude will make things easier.</i>

06:30.170 --> 06:31.370
Thank you.

06:34.320 --> 06:37.120
<i>I tried cooking for them with 
the ingredients and utensils</i>

06:37.120 --> 06:39.310
<i>that were among the plunder.</i>

06:40.130 --> 06:42.770
<i>You need food to live,</i>

06:42.770 --> 06:48.140
<i>and the better it is, the more it can 
act like a balm for your feelings.</i>

06:48.450 --> 06:54.140
<i>Humans don't evolve the way we do, but in 
exchange, they seem to have a variety of jobs.</i>

06:54.140 --> 06:57.630
<i>The absent-minded girl is 
an appraiser and a smith.</i>

06:58.150 --> 07:00.610
<i>Both of the sisters are 
cooks as well as tailors.</i>

07:01.150 --> 07:04.650
<i>And the girl in glasses is
 supposedly an alchemist.</i>

07:05.550 --> 07:08.560
<i>The plucky redhead 
who greeted me in the morning</i>

07:08.560 --> 07:10.660
<i>seems to be a rookie warrior...</i>

07:11.010 --> 07:15.670
<i>But she's not a lot of help right now, 
so I'll have her join us for training later on.</i>

07:15.670 --> 07:19.670
Age doesn't matter! From here on, 
this is a meritocracy!

07:20.670 --> 07:22.710
C-Can't keep going...

07:22.710 --> 07:26.460
What's wrong?! Did you survive 
this long on pure luck?!

07:26.460 --> 07:27.240
Say what?!

07:27.240 --> 07:28.680
You little shit!

07:31.180 --> 07:35.180
<i>For the next few days, instead of hunting, 
I focused on group exercises</i>

07:35.500 --> 07:38.500
<i>along with having them learn the rules I set.</i>

07:39.940 --> 07:42.440
<b>Day 31</b>

07:43.240 --> 07:45.200
<i>It was a rainy day...</i>

07:45.200 --> 07:49.360
<i>Gobkichi and I were doing 
some serious sparring.</i>

07:49.360 --> 07:51.450
Not bad, Gobkichi!

07:53.010 --> 07:54.230
Are you done?!

07:54.230 --> 07:55.080
Not yet!

07:55.080 --> 07:56.470
Come on, Gobrou!

07:56.470 --> 07:57.850
That's more like it!

08:06.490 --> 08:09.970
<i>It happened after nightfall.</i>

08:12.470 --> 08:14.110
You sure about this?

08:14.110 --> 08:17.050
We've got five fine pieces like that,

08:17.050 --> 08:19.980
and we're supposed to sit back and do nothing?

08:23.720 --> 08:25.980
They're fast asleep.

08:25.980 --> 08:27.990
You should be, too.

08:44.150 --> 08:47.970
I told you to keep your 
hands off them the other day.

08:47.970 --> 08:50.380
You just don't get it, kid...

08:50.380 --> 08:52.800
You don't get how sweet a
 human woman really is—

09:02.910 --> 09:04.730
Sorry for the scare.

09:15.240 --> 09:16.610
What's the noise about?!

09:16.610 --> 09:21.060
Good timing. Gobkichi, 
drag these guys outside.

09:21.060 --> 09:22.750
O-Okay.

09:23.070 --> 09:26.100
Gobmi, wake the others and
 have them gather around.

09:26.450 --> 09:30.410
They need to see what I'm about to do.

09:59.090 --> 10:03.170
Now then, everyone, do you 
understand our village's rules?

10:04.860 --> 10:06.170
Okay, dismissed!

10:08.670 --> 10:10.670
<i>I stopped just short of killing him,</i>

10:11.170 --> 10:15.050
<i>which meant that Hobken, 
who got the worst punishment,</i>

10:15.050 --> 10:17.300
<i>passed away the next morning.</i>

10:17.800 --> 10:20.310
<b>Day 32</b>

10:23.520 --> 10:25.020
Those scales are sturdy!

10:30.370 --> 10:31.130
Gobkichi!

10:31.130 --> 10:31.860
Right!

10:39.670 --> 10:43.370
<i>The tri-horn horse was tough to take down.</i>

10:43.790 --> 10:45.240
<i>But that also meant....</i>

10:46.540 --> 10:48.540
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Scale Drive]</b>

10:46.540 --> 10:51.250
<i>Scale Drive. Scaled Horse's Cry. 
Quick Healing.</i>

10:48.670 --> 10:49.960
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Scaled Horse's Cry]</b>

10:50.000 --> 10:51.250
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Quick Healing]</b>

10:50.130 --> 10:52.420
<i>Oh, damn!</i>

10:51.250 --> 10:55.220
<i>Kick Proficiency. Pierce 
Proficiency Up. Triple Thrust.</i>

10:51.380 --> 10:52.670
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Kick Proficiency]</b>

10:52.670 --> 10:54.010
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Pierce Proficiency Up]</b>

10:54.050 --> 10:55.220
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Triple Thrust]</b>

10:56.930 --> 10:58.600
<i>Triple Thrust.</i>

10:58.600 --> 11:04.360
<i>I don't know how, but a single strike 
with it results in three blows.</i>

11:04.360 --> 11:07.850
<i>That just goes to show how 
dangerous the tri-horn horse was.</i>

11:33.400 --> 11:36.420
<i>Last night must've been really scary for her.</i>

11:36.960 --> 11:41.680
<i>So, I ended up spending the night 
with the short-haired redhead.</i>

11:43.470 --> 11:45.980
<b>Day 33</b>

11:51.170 --> 11:55.870
<i>When I woke up, I saw that Gobmi had 
climbed into my bed on the opposite side.</i>

11:56.380 --> 12:00.370
<i>My arms were aching for a while 
from both of them sleeping on them.</i>

12:04.540 --> 12:06.300
Gobe...?

12:07.330 --> 12:08.780
What a shock, am I right?

12:08.780 --> 12:13.160
<i>Gobe had been carrying our gear lately,</i>

12:13.160 --> 12:16.010
<i>and at some point evolved 
into a hobgoblin herself.</i>

12:16.890 --> 12:22.010
<i>The training's been going great. Gobkichi 
is the captain of our armored fighters.</i>

12:23.000 --> 12:25.520
<i>Gobmi runs the ranged unit.</i>

12:26.270 --> 12:29.520
<i>Hobsato handles the mobility-oriented, 
lightly-armored force.</i>

12:30.270 --> 12:34.520
<i>Gobe has taken over rear support, 
which mostly consists of assorted chores.</i>

12:35.170 --> 12:38.570
<i>And the village's only mage, Hobsei,</i>

12:38.570 --> 12:42.180
<i>would be acting as the 
captain of our magic force...</i>

12:42.630 --> 12:45.000
<i>But right now, she's an army of one.</i>

12:46.450 --> 12:50.050
<i>That day, I decided to leave the
 training to the assorted captains,</i>

12:50.050 --> 12:55.210
<i>while I went deeper into the woods 
to hunt a variety of prey.</i>

13:02.000 --> 13:03.720
It's worth a shot.

13:03.720 --> 13:07.400
Phase 1 Demise Magic... Gáe Derg!

13:14.440 --> 13:19.900
<i>I might have gotten a little cocky after
 using attack magic for the first time.</i>

13:20.620 --> 13:23.880
<i>I went further north into the forest.</i>

13:27.760 --> 13:30.450
I've walked a long way.

13:37.040 --> 13:40.700
<i>That's when I remembered...</i>

13:40.700 --> 13:42.780
Now, listen up, children...

13:42.780 --> 13:47.730
Do not, and I mean never, 
enter the northern woods.

13:47.730 --> 13:54.100
Deep in there lives a massive, 
crimson creature called the red bear!

13:54.580 --> 13:59.360
That's right... This is deep in
 the northern woods, like he said.

14:00.030 --> 14:04.130
A tri-horn horse's armor is so hard 
for us to pierce, and yet...

14:17.130 --> 14:21.360
That's the red bear!

14:27.410 --> 14:31.920
<i>Anyone rational being 
would probably have run already.</i>

14:31.920 --> 14:33.300
<i>But I...</i>

14:34.330 --> 14:38.220
<i>I find myself thinking up a
 plan to take this thing down.</i>

14:39.700 --> 14:43.710
<i>I want to fight it. Beat it. And eat it.</i>

14:43.710 --> 14:46.640
<i>I could feel my instincts urging me on...</i>

14:49.060 --> 14:52.130
Phase 1 Demise Magic: Gáe Derg.

14:52.130 --> 14:58.600
<i>Which is why I will use everything
 I have to bring it down!</i>

15:05.950 --> 15:07.730
What's up, Gobmi?

15:07.730 --> 15:10.130
Gobrou hasn't come back yet.

15:10.130 --> 15:12.720
Now that you mention it, I ain't seen him.

15:12.720 --> 15:15.250
Gimme a sec. I'll ask the others.

15:15.600 --> 15:19.760
No. I haven't seen him. 
I've been training all day.

15:20.110 --> 15:24.760
I dunno. But Gobrou's so strong, 
he's probably fine, right?

15:25.110 --> 15:29.120
I've been reading this magic book all day.

15:29.120 --> 15:30.570
And there you have it.

15:31.020 --> 15:32.290
Thanks, anyway.

15:41.500 --> 15:42.630
<i>He...</i>

15:46.050 --> 15:49.890
<i>He sacrificed his right arm 
to defend against that spell!</i>

15:49.890 --> 15:51.550
<i>Talk about sharp instincts!</i>

15:56.140 --> 15:57.600
<i>And those claws...</i>

15:57.600 --> 16:01.310
<i>I don't think the Refined Scale Armor 
I got from the tri-horn horse will help!</i>

16:02.480 --> 16:03.320
<i>In that case...</i>

16:13.000 --> 16:15.120
<i>Even tougher than I imagined!</i>

16:20.380 --> 16:21.540
How about this?!

16:33.100 --> 16:34.400
Whoa!

16:57.020 --> 16:59.160
<i>That must have been 2,000 degrees...</i>

16:59.160 --> 17:04.280
<i>I never saw or even heard of a
 fire-breathing bear in my past life.</i>

17:04.720 --> 17:08.430
<i>I'm gonna have to be willing to 
take some damage to get this done.</i>

17:15.600 --> 17:17.110
Here I come!

17:19.110 --> 17:21.100
Alright, let's see that fire!

17:23.910 --> 17:25.860
You might be sturdy on the outside...

17:39.950 --> 17:42.460
But how about the inside of your mouth?!

18:03.270 --> 18:05.710
We'll call that round a draw.

18:07.860 --> 18:10.640
<i>My blade's still inside his mouth.</i>

18:10.640 --> 18:12.740
<i>He won't be able to breathe fire again.</i>

18:16.910 --> 18:19.070
<i>That's a hell of a roar.</i>

18:19.680 --> 18:23.480
<i>Most living things would freeze up 
at the sound of it...</i>

18:24.160 --> 18:30.760
<i>There's no sign of it collapsing, but if
 I take one more attack, I'm likely to die.</i>

18:30.760 --> 18:33.380
<i>I'm at a huge disadvantage here...</i>

18:35.890 --> 18:39.350
But that'll just make the meal taste better!

18:48.700 --> 18:49.770
I'm hungry!

19:02.000 --> 19:03.000
I...

19:05.060 --> 19:06.460
want to...

19:08.280 --> 19:09.630
eat you!

19:19.050 --> 19:21.560
<b>Day 34</b>

19:37.610 --> 19:40.330
I won... I guess.

19:50.340 --> 19:52.380
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Heavy Damage]</b>

19:50.650 --> 19:53.760
<i>Heavy Damage. Overpowering Strength.</i>

19:52.460 --> 19:53.760
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Overpowering Strength]</b>

20:01.010 --> 20:04.020
<b>Level Values Exceeded</b>

20:04.020 --> 20:07.020
<b>Now that the special conditions</b>

20:04.020 --> 20:07.020
<b>[Murderer of Champions]</b>

20:04.020 --> 20:07.020
<b>[Conqueror's Posture]</b>

20:04.020 --> 20:07.020
<b>[■God■ ■]</b>

20:04.020 --> 20:07.020
<b>have been cleared</b>

20:07.020 --> 20:13.020
<b>[Evolutionary Advance] into
[Rare Ogre Species] now possible.</b>

20:10.190 --> 20:12.650
<i>As my consciousness was fading...</i>

20:12.650 --> 20:16.010
<i>I selected yes.</i>

20:13.020 --> 20:16.030
<b>Will you [evolve] now?</b>

21:46.530 --> 21:49.040
<b>Day 35</b>

21:50.420 --> 21:52.900
So hungry...

21:58.050 --> 22:00.470
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Mountain Lord]</b>

21:58.050 --> 22:03.220
<i>Howl of the Mountain Lord. 
Threatening Glint. All Tolerance.</i>

22:00.630 --> 22:01.970
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [Threatening Glint]</b>

22:02.050 --> 22:03.220
<b>You Have Learned the Ability [All Tolerance]</b>

22:03.220 --> 22:07.300
Oh, yeah... I should get it's pelt.

22:07.920 --> 22:11.980
Huh. Was this knife always so small?

22:19.760 --> 22:22.860
I think... I'm an ogre now.

22:25.870 --> 22:27.790
I-It's an ogre attack!

22:27.790 --> 22:28.920
Everybody, get out here!

22:28.920 --> 22:29.940
Get him before he gets us!

22:29.940 --> 22:32.350
Uh, actually...

22:35.880 --> 22:37.490
He's smiling!

22:37.490 --> 22:40.610
Why is Gobrou missing at a time like this?!

22:40.610 --> 22:41.630
Gobrou?!

22:43.320 --> 22:45.890
Yeah. Uh... I'm back—

22:45.890 --> 22:48.390
Where have you been, you jerk?!

22:48.830 --> 22:50.890
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow...

22:51.560 --> 22:54.140
You have no idea how worried I was!

22:54.140 --> 22:56.160
You're absolutely right.

22:56.160 --> 22:58.400
And what happened to your left arm?!

22:58.400 --> 23:01.630
You really are amazing, Gobrou!

23:01.630 --> 23:03.720
I seriously can't believe it.

23:03.720 --> 23:07.410
The red bear's supposed to be 
able to kill and eat ogres...

23:07.410 --> 23:11.090
In the month since you were born, you've 
defeated the master of the northern woods,

23:11.090 --> 23:13.410
and evolved into a ogre...

23:14.170 --> 23:20.430
<i>Gobmi chewed me out for a while, and then 
came the questions from everyone else.</i>

23:20.920 --> 23:25.200
<i>But... I managed to survive, 
and make it home.</i>

23:25.930 --> 23:30.010
<i>To this place, where my second life began.</i>

23:30.010 --> 23:40.020
<b>Next Time:</b>
